      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_End%2C_Queensland",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Expo 88 revitalised West End, replacing older accommodation with upscale apartments and attracting tourists and wealthy residents.",
